sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client or UI
  participant R as Reservation
  participant I as Inventory
  participant P as Payment
  participant N as Notification
  C->>R: Create booking with key
  R->>R: Claim key and persist PENDING
  R->>I: Hold room with stable key
  I-->>R: HELD and price
  R->>P: Charge with stable key
  alt Charge succeeds
    P-->>R: CHARGED
    R->>I: Confirm hold
    R->>R: Persist CONFIRMED
    R->>N: Send confirmation
    N-->>R: SENT or FAILED
    R-->>C: Saved 201 result
  else Known decline at step 3
    P-->>R: DECLINED
    R->>R: Persist COMPENSATING
    R->>I: Release hold once
    R->>R: Persist CANCELLED
    R-->>C: Saved 402 result
  else Timeout or outage
    R->>R: Persist PAYMENT_UNCERTAIN
    R-->>C: Saved 202 acceptance
    R->>P: Resolve outcome then retry stable key
    C->>R: GET current booking
  end
